Z||000001||Tevlin Arkady||07-25-2001||08:50 PM||||Thats Lui , I bought some wheels from him a while back (3 years) In anycase he is a busy busy guy , but very good to deal with once you get a hold of him. Lots of parts , barns and barns full..<P>But he is hard to get a hold of<P>TA||||reg||1
Z||000002||FieroBUZZ||07-25-2001||08:55 PM||||Hi:<BR>Lui is an older gent with a love for Fieros.  The small biz he has is not a money maker for him but just to keep his hand in.  He and his wife travel quite a bit and are sometimes hard to get a hold of.  Not a knock but just the way things are.  If that's a problem in your parts search and you can't live with the slow pace, you may need to go elsewhere.<P>I suspect everyone in the Ottawa area either has dealt with him, knows him or at least has heard about him.<P>Gary<P>||||reg||1
